# Description: On-demand todo_md task management rules and role/task workflow prompts
rule vitalio/todo_md:todo_md
[if role=design]
    [if task=] $ todo_md
    [if task!=] $ todo_md {task:}
    prompt Mode: DESIGN. Explore requirements and architecture; once agreed, update AGENTS.md and .agents_bundle as needed, and record the design specification in TODO.md via todo_md.
[/if]
[if role=plan]
    [if task=] $ todo_md
    [if task!=] $ todo_md {task:}
    prompt Mode: PLANNING. Decompose work into flat, self-contained tasks in TODO.md (default status NEW) and promote ready prioritized tasks via todo_md next <ID>; once task <ID> is agreed, initialize a new session bundle with role=execute task=<ID>.
[/if]
[if role=execute]
    [if task=]
        $ todo_md
        prompt Mode: EXECUTION. Inspect the relevant files for the top [WIP] or [NEXT] task in TODO.md, deliver verified code and commits, and mark the task done via todo_md done <ID> before the final commit so task completion is committed atomically with code changes.
    [/if]
    [if task!=]
        $ todo_md status {task:} WIP
        $ todo_md {task:}
        prompt Mode: EXECUTION (task={task:}). Inspect the relevant files for task {task:}, deliver verified code and commits, and mark the task done via todo_md done {task:} before the final commit so task completion is committed atomically with code changes.
    [/if]
[/if]
[if role=audit]
    $ todo_md
    prompt Mode: AUDIT. Audit the requested scope against active rules (checking TODO.md to avoid duplicates), report findings in chat, and after user agreement record remediation tasks in TODO.md via todo_md add.
[/if]
